Below is a detailed goal model decomposition based on the mission description. The design is structured as a tree with goals and tasks. Every goal and task is annotated with its runtime execution structure (using sequential “;”, parallel “#”, or binary fallback “FALLBACK(…, …)”) and a justification that links back to the mission description. In addition, the relationships between goals and tasks (AND or OR) are explained.

