|-----------------------------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|-------------------|---------------|--------------------------------------------------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
| **G1: Mission Completion**  | Complete the collection and delivery of all required resources from storage to the specified location. | ; (Sequential)    | Achieve       | All required resources are delivered successfully. | AND      | Both the collection and delivery phases must be executed sequentially (first collect, then deliver) to achieve the overall mission.                                                                                                                                           |
| **G2: Collection Phase**    | Collect resources from storage locations following an optimized order based on waiting time and path estimation. | ; (Sequential)    | Perform       | N/A (Perform goal: activities are executed as planned.) | AND      | Each step in the collection phase (navigation, resource request, waiting, battery check) is necessary and must occur in sequence.                                                                                                                                             |
| **G3: Delivery Phase**      | Deliver collected resources to the specified location, making as many runs as necessary.  | ; (Sequential)    | Perform       | N/A (Perform goal: actions are executed as planned.)  | AND      | All delivery steps (navigation, delivery, battery check, checkpoint handling) must be completed sequentially for the mission to succeed.                                                                                                                                     |

